{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/75634eef632692ef2986f97b088a3b8f.avif?t=1752885181\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcc4 <strong>PROTOCOL EE-3159620 \u2014 INFORMATION FILE FOR TEST SUBJECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sender:</strong> Telescreen Defense Corp \u2014 Department of Cooperative Experiments<br><strong>Recipients:</strong> Voluntary subjects assigned to the <i>EMERGENCY EXIT</i> simulation<br><strong>Subject:</strong> General instructions for participation and obligations</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 <strong>PREAMBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I, the undersigned, voluntary test subject, acknowledge that the <i>EMERGENCY EXIT</i> program (EE-3159620 \u2013\u202f2025) is a cooperative simulation.<br>This simulation evaluates the subjects\u2019 ability to communicate, solve complex problems, and act under pressure in a hostile environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I understand that my chances of success depend exclusively on my coordination with the partner assigned to me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a3 <strong>SIMULATION MODALITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two operators. Two distinct roles. One single exit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726 <strong>Operator\u202f1</strong><br>\u2022 Alone in the corridors of the complex.<br>\u2022 Equipped with a simple flashlight with limited battery.<br>\u2022 Progresses through a dark evacuation plan, exposed to flames, traps, and biological anomalies.<br>\u2022 Must demonstrate orientation, observation, and composure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/player1_illustration.gif?t=1752885181\" /></div>\u25a3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3\u00a0<strong>Operator\u202f2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Confined to the control room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Cannot see Operator\u202f1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Guides their partner using the provided emergency manual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Controls and monitors the environment to allow progression, while managing the power supply on which the various systems depend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/sequential_signature_illustration.gif?t=1752885181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c8 <strong>OBJECTIVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2610 Reach the exit before the time runs out.<br>\u2610 Maintain clear and continuous communication.<br>\u2610 Solve the puzzles and challenges encountered together.<br>\u2610 Discover the journals and documents left by previous test subjects.<br>\u2610 Achieve the best scores and surpass other subjects.<br>\u2610 Complete the experience in both roles to finalize your file and validate your contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/level_selection_illustration.gif?t=1752885181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3 <strong>ADDITIONAL NOTES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Several difficulty levels are available (and additional game modes to come).<br>\u2022 Two final outcomes are recorded.<br>\u2022 The simulation contains optional and secret elements to discover.<br>\u2022 The results will be archived in your personal file.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/diary.gif?t=1752885181\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 <strong>REMARKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Emergency Exit does not offer a traditional tutorial. This is a deliberate choice.</i><br><br><i>The game invites you to discover its mechanics and rules through exploration and experimentation, and rewards curiosity and observation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/countdown.gif?t=1752885181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please also confirm your participation by adding this program to your wishlist.<br>Thank you for your cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/communicate_collaborate_escape.png?t=1752885181\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Emergency Exit Reached","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/bdbe5a98bb8746f7cd2de02d737cb28dd88606b4.jpg"},{"name":"That was close..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/6b6bf594cec68da1b7cb3c51a2407e63eff3ba4a.jpg"},{"name":"It Takes Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/eb0ddbdea8d0c28212f6934285f8f9ce5eded8b1.jpg"},{"name":"Dear diary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/4a2870f5f22b3144be0278ec4dcc8685b9d67b65.jpg"},{"name":"More haste, less speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/db2fcaf3bd849c5dc7883b2b436732ab45199117.jpg"},{"name":"Not So Cheeky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/5121498f7b3ec65b8a34ddbd9943980a59c764c7.jpg"},{"name":"Keep Talking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/6a72a980ab2489e73e8b56432198bf33c66ef708.jpg"},{"name":"Please don't touch this","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/a1e7336ce2770aaa2a457f277109100ab715c04d.jpg"},{"name":"One note can hide another","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/7ba1009f3870f3c8e01ec43e3b5d964f3a78223b.jpg"},{"name":"CAT-TRICK !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/61ac23083d77de5ef6e75e63dcf7972f7053100d.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159620?t=1752885181","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159620?t=1752885181","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/e3db41c59a891b254afae009b3cebcd175ac5301/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752885181","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/e3db41c59a891b254afae009b3cebcd175ac5301/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752885181","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3220810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/75634eef632692ef2986f97b088a3b8f.avif?t=1752885181\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcc4 <strong>PROTOCOL EE-3159620 \u2014 INFORMATION FILE FOR TEST SUBJECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sender:</strong> Telescreen Defense Corp \u2014 Department of Cooperative Ex